      <h1 class="home-title">EPSTEIN CLICKER</h1>
      <p class="home-tagline">Click to earn points. Buy upgrades to earn more per click and per second. Save your score and climb the leaderboard.</p>
      <div class="home-buttons">
        <a href="play.html" class="home-btn home-btn-primary">PLAY GAME</a>
        <a href="leaderboard.html" class="home-btn home-btn-secondary">LEADERBOARD</a>
